<p><%= @owner.name_with_display_owner %> has reached <%= ActiveSupport::NumberHelper.number_to_delimited(@limiter.count) %> repositories.</p>

<p>This is above the supported limit and <%= @owner.name_with_display_owner %> will not be able to create additional repositories.</p>

<p>Try deleting inactive repositories, migrating select repositories to a different owner, or <a class="Link--inTextBlock" href="<%= GitHub.contact_support_url(tags: 'dotcom-organizations') %>">contact support</a>.</p>

<p>Visit the <a href="https://gh.io/repo-limits">repository limits page</a> to learn more.</p>
